  "title": "Chef John's Baked Acorn Squash",
  "description": "Chef John's baked acorn squash recipe scores the squash before baking, making for a great presentation. It also allows the glaze to penetrate the squash.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
